This sounds a little like the Omega combat descriptions.  Omega actually has
more detailed combat options including four types of move and choice of high,
center or low, plus extra features to add color.  So you may get:

You lunge low.  You totally avoid contact with the Goblin. -more-
The Goblin cuts center!  You blocked it! -more-
The Goblin missed you.  The Goblin is seriously ashamed!
You lunge low.  You inflict bodily harm on the Goblin. -more-
The Goblin flailed stupidly at you. -more- 
The Goblin curses your ancestry!
You lunge low.  You smash the Goblin! -more-

.... and so on.  And yes, it makes combat more interesting!

